{
 "lane": "tools",
 "slug": "freelance-cash-flow-forecaster",
 "title": "Freelance Cash Flow Forecaster",
 "description": "See week by week when your invoices will really land after payment terms and late-paying clients, and which weeks your bank balance dips below the cushion you want to keep. 13-week forecast with a chart, a stress test for extra late payments and unsent work, and CSV copy. Runs in your browser, nothing is sent anywhere.",
 "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Freelance Cash Flow Forecaster</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f7f7f5;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d1d1f;--mute:#5f6368;--line:#dcdcd8;--acc:#2f6f5e;--acc2:#7fb8a6;--warn:#a4372a;--warnbg:#fbecea;--soft:#eef4f1;--amber:#8a5a00;--amberbg:#fdf3dc}\n@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#141517;--card:#1e2023;--ink:#ececec;--mute:#a3a7ad;--line:#33363b;--acc:#6cc3a6;--acc2:#3d7a67;--warn:#f08a7a;--warnbg:#3a2220;--soft:#1f2b27;--amber:#f0c060;--amberbg:#3a3020}}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 48px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:.2em 0}p.lead{color:var(--mute);margin-top:0;max-width:760px}\nh2{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 10px}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin:0 0 16px}\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:10px}\nlabel{display:block;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--mute);margin-bottom:3px}\ninput,select{width:100%;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;min-width:0}\ninput[type=range]{padding:0}\n.hint{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--mute);margin:6px 0 0}\n.rows .row{display:grid;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;align-items:end}\n.inv .row{grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1.2fr .9fr .9fr 1fr 36px}\n.cost .row{grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr 36px}\n.rows .row label{display:none}\n.rows .head{display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--mute);margin-bottom:4px}\n.inv .head{grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1.2fr .9fr .9fr 1fr 36px}\n.cost .head{grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr 36px}\nbutton{font:inherit;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer}\nbutton.primary{background:var(--acc);border-color:var(--acc);color:#fff}\n@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){button.primary{color:#0f1a16}}\nbutton.x{padding:6px 0;width:36px;color:var(--mute)}\n.btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px}\n.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}\n.stat{background:var(--soft);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px}\n.stat b{display:block;font-size:1.3rem}\n.stat span{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--mute)}\n.stat.bad{background:var(--warnbg)}.stat.bad b{color:var(--warn)}\n.stat.mid{background:var(--amberbg)}.stat.mid b{color:var(--amber)}\n.verdict{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:12px;background:var(--soft)}\n.verdict.bad{background:var(--warnbg)}.verdict.mid{background:var(--amberbg)}\n.tablewrap{overflow-x:auto}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.9rem}\nth,td{text-align:left;padding:7px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}\nth{color:var(--mute);font-weight:600;font-size:.8rem}\ntd.num,th.num{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}\ntd small{color:var(--mute);display:block}\ntr.low td{background:var(--warnbg)}tr.thin td{background:var(--amberbg)}\n.neg{color:var(--warn);font-weight:600}\nsvg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n.legend{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--mute);margin-top:6px}\n.sw{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:middle}\nul.tips{margin:0;padding-left:20px}ul.tips li{margin-bottom:6px}\n@media (max-width:760px){\n .inv .head,.cost .head{display:none}\n .inv .row,.cost .row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px;margin-bottom:10px}\n .rows .row label{display:block}\n .rows .row .full{grid-column:1/-1}\n button.x{width:auto;padding:6px 10px}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body><main>\n<h1>Freelance Cash Flow Forecaster</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">See week by week when your invoices will really land, after payment terms and the days each client is usually late, and spot the weeks your balance dips below the cushion you want to keep. Plan 13 weeks ahead. Nothing you type leaves this page.</p>\n\n<section class=\"card\">\n<h2>1. Starting point</h2>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<div><label for=\"start\">Forecast starts (a Monday works best)</label><input type=\"date\" id=\"start\"></div>\n<div><label for=\"bal\">Money in the bank today ($)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"bal\" step=\"1\" value=\"5600\"></div>\n<div><label for=\"buffer\">Cushion you want to keep ($)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"buffer\" step=\"1\" value=\"2500\"></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"hint\">The cushion is the lowest balance you're comfortable with. A common rule of thumb is one month of essential costs.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"card\">\n<h2>2. Money coming in</h2>\n<div class=\"rows inv\">\n<div class=\"head\"><span>Client / job</span><span>Amount ($)</span><span>Invoice date</span><span>Terms (days)</span><span>Usually late (days)</span><span>Status</span><span></span></div>\n<div id=\"invRows\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btns\"><button id=\"addInv\">+ Add invoice</button></div>\n<p class=\"hint\">Expected pay date = invoice date + terms + days late. Use \"Planned\" for invoices you haven't sent yet (the date you plan to send them). Not sure how late a client pays? Look at their last three payments.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"card\">\n<h2>3. Money going out</h2>\n<div class=\"rows cost\">\n<div class=\"head\"><span>What</span><span>Amount ($)</span><span>How often</span><span>Date (first or only)</span><span></span></div>\n<div id=\"costRows\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btns\"><button id=\"addCost\">+ Add cost</button></div>\n<p class=\"hint\">Include what you pay yourself, rent, software, insurance and money you set aside for tax. Monthly costs repeat on the same day each month; weekly ones on the same weekday.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"card\">\n<h2>4. Stress test</h2>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<div><label for=\"delay\">Every client pays this many extra days late: <b id=\"delayOut\">0</b></label><input type=\"range\" id=\"delay\" min=\"0\" max=\"45\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></div>\n<div><label for=\"planned\">Planned invoices</label><select id=\"planned\"><option value=\"1\">Include them</option><option value=\"0\">Leave them out (only sent invoices)</option></select></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"hint\">Try 14 extra days and leaving out planned work. If you still stay above your cushion, your cash flow is in good shape.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"card\" id=\"results\">\n<h2>Your 13-week forecast</h2>\n<div id=\"verdict\" class=\"verdict\"></div>\n<div class=\"stats\" id=\"stats\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:var(--acc)\"></i>Balance at end of week</span><span><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:var(--warn)\"></i>Below cushion or below zero</span><span><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:var(--amber)\"></i>Cushion line</span></div>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><table id=\"weeks\"><thead><tr><th>Week starting</th><th>Money in</th><th class=\"num\">In</th><th class=\"num\">Out</th><th class=\"num\">End balance</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>\n<div id=\"later\"></div>\n<div class=\"btns\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><button class=\"primary\" id=\"copy\">Copy forecast as CSV</button><button id=\"example\">Load example</button><button id=\"clear\">Clear all</button></div>\n<p class=\"hint\" id=\"copyMsg\"></p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"card\">\n<h2>If a low week is coming</h2>\n<ul class=\"tips\">\n<li><b>Invoice earlier.</b> Send invoices the day work is approved, not at month end. Moving a planned invoice forward a week often fixes a dip on its own.</li>\n<li><b>Shorten terms on new work.</b> 14 days instead of 30, or a deposit up front, pulls money forward without changing your price.</li>\n<li><b>Chase before it's late.</b> A friendly note three days before the due date gets many invoices paid on time.</li>\n<li><b>Move flexible costs.</b> Annual software renewals, equipment and courses can usually wait a few weeks.</li>\n<li><b>Know your slow payers.</b> If one client is always 20 days late, put that into the forecast and your terms for them.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"hint\">This is a planning aid, not financial advice. Forecasts are only as good as the dates you enter.</p>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function(){\nvar W=13;\nvar $=function(id){return document.getElementById(id)};\nfunction pad(n){return (n<10?'0':'')+n}\nfunction iso(d){return d.getFullYear()+'-'+pad(d.getMonth()+1)+'-'+pad(d.getDate())}\nfunction parse(s){if(!s)return null;var p=s.split('-');if(p.length!==3)return null;var d=new Date(+p[0],+p[1]-1,+p[2]);return isNaN(d)?null:d}\nfunction addDays(d,n){var x=new Date(d.getFullYear(),d.getMonth(),d.getDate()+n);return x}\nfunction dayDiff(a,b){return Math.round((Date.UTC(b.getFullYear(),b.getMonth(),b.getDate())-Date.UTC(a.getFullYear(),a.getMonth(),a.getDate()))/864e5)}\nvar MON=['Jan','Feb','Mar','Apr','May','Jun','Jul','Aug','Sep','Oct','Nov','Dec'];\nfunction nice(d){return d.getDate()+' '+MON[d.getMonth()]}\nfunction money(n){var neg=n<0;n=Math.abs(Math.round(n));var s=n.toString().replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g,',');return (neg?'-$':'$')+s}\nfunction num(v){var n=parseFloat(v);return isNaN(n)?0:n}\nfunction esc(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>\"']/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[c]})}\n\nfunction field(lbl,html,cls){return '<div class=\"'+(cls||'')+'\"><label>'+lbl+'</label>'+html+'</div>'}\nfunction invRow(v){\n v=v||{};var r=document.createElement('div');r.className='row';\n r.innerHTML=field('Client / job','<input data-k=\"name\" value=\"'+esc(v.name||'')+'\" placeholder=\"Client or job\">','full')+\n field('Amount ($)','<input type=\"number\" data-k=\"amt\" step=\"1\" value=\"'+(v.amt!=null?v.amt:'')+'\">')+\n field('Invoice date','<input type=\"date\" data-k=\"date\" value=\"'+(v.date||'')+'\">')+\n field('Terms (days)','<input type=\"number\" data-k=\"terms\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"'+(v.terms!=null?v.terms:30)+'\">')+\n field('Usually late (days)','<input type=\"number\" data-k=\"late\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"'+(v.late!=null?v.late:0)+'\">')+\n field('Status','<select data-k=\"status\"><option value=\"sent\"'+(v.status==='planned'?'':' selected')+'>Sent</option><option value=\"planned\"'+(v.status==='planned'?' selected':'')+'>Planned</option></select>')+\n '<button class=\"x\" title=\"Remove\" aria-label=\"Remove invoice\">&#x2715;</button>';\n $('invRows').appendChild(r);\n}\nfunction costRow(v){\n v=v||{};var r=document.createElement('div');r.className='row';\n r.innerHTML=field('What','<input data-k=\"name\" value=\"'+esc(v.name||'')+'\" placeholder=\"Rent, pay myself, software\">','full')+\n field('Amount ($)','<input type=\"number\" data-k=\"amt\" step=\"1\" value=\"'+(v.amt!=null?v.amt:'')+'\">')+\n field('How often','<select data-k=\"freq\"><option value=\"m\"'+(v.freq==='m'||!v.freq?' selected':'')+'>Monthly</option><option value=\"w\"'+(v.freq==='w'?' selected':'')+'>Weekly</option><option value=\"o\"'+(v.freq==='o'?' selected':'')+'>One-off</option></select>')+\n field('Date (first or only)','<input type=\"date\" data-k=\"date\" value=\"'+(v.date||'')+'\">')+\n '<button class=\"x\" title=\"Remove\" aria-label=\"Remove cost\">&#x2715;</button>';\n $('costRows').appendChild(r);\n}\nfunction read(box){\n var out=[];var rows=$(box).querySelectorAll('.row');\n for(var i=0;i<rows.length;i++){var o={};var els=rows[i].querySelectorAll('[data-k]');for(var j=0;j<els.length;j++)o[els[j].getAttribute('data-k')]=els[j].value;out.push(o)}\n return out;\n}\n\nvar lastCSV='';\nfunction calc(){\n var start=parse($('start').value)||new Date();start=new Date(start.getFullYear(),start.getMonth(),start.getDate());\n var end=addDays(start,W*7);\n var bal=num($('bal').value),buffer=num($('buffer').value),extra=num($('delay').value),usePlanned=$('planned').value==='1';\n $('delayOut').textContent=extra;\n var weeks=[];for(var i=0;i<W;i++)weeks.push({start:addDays(start,i*7),inn:0,out:0,items:[],costs:[]});\n var later=[],overdue=[],skipped=0;\n read('invRows').forEach(function(v){\n  var amt=num(v.amt),d=parse(v.date);if(!amt||!d)return;\n  if(v.status==='planned'&&!usePlanned){skipped+=amt;return}\n  var pay=addDays(d,num(v.terms)+num(v.late)+extra);\n  var name=v.name||'Invoice';\n  if(pay<start){overdue.push({name:name,amt:amt,pay:pay});pay=start}\n  var idx=Math.floor(dayDiff(start,pay)/7);\n  if(idx>=W){later.push({name:name,amt:amt,pay:pay});return}\n  weeks[idx].inn+=amt;weeks[idx].items.push(name+' '+money(amt)+(v.status==='planned'?' (planned)':''));\n });\n read('costRows').forEach(function(v){\n  var amt=num(v.amt),d=parse(v.date);if(!amt||!d)return;var name=v.name||'Cost';\n  function put(x){if(x<start||x>=end)return;var idx=Math.floor(dayDiff(start,x)/7);weeks[idx].out+=amt;weeks[idx].costs.push(name)}\n  if(v.freq==='o')put(d);\n  else if(v.freq==='w'){var x=d;while(x<start)x=addDays(x,7);while(x<end){put(x);x=addDays(x,7)}}\n  else{var day=d.getDate();var y=start.getFullYear(),m=start.getMonth()-1;\n   for(var k=0;k<5;k++){var last=new Date(y,m+k+1,0).getDate();var x2=new Date(y,m+k,Math.min(day,last));if(x2>=d)put(x2)}}\n });\n var running=bal,low=bal,lowWeek=null,below=0,neg=0,tin=0,tout=0;\n var rows='',csv='week_start,money_in,money_out,end_balance,income_items,cost_items\\n';\n weeks.forEach(function(w){\n  running+=w.inn-w.out;w.end=running;tin+=w.inn;tout+=w.out;\n  if(running<low){low=running;lowWeek=w}\n  if(running<0)neg++;else if(running<buffer)below++;\n  var cls=running<0?'low':(running<buffer?'thin':'');\n  rows+='<tr class=\"'+cls+'\"><td>'+nice(w.start)+'</td><td>'+(w.items.length?esc(w.items.join(', ')):'<span style=\"color:var(--mute)\">-</span>')+(w.costs.length?'<small>Out: '+esc(w.costs.join(', '))+'</small>':'')+'</td><td class=\"num\">'+(w.inn?money(w.inn):'-')+'</td><td class=\"num\">'+(w.out?money(w.out):'-')+'</td><td class=\"num'+(running<0?' neg':'')+'\">'+money(running)+'</td></tr>';\n  csv+=[iso(w.start),Math.round(w.inn),Math.round(w.out),Math.round(running),'\"'+w.items.join('; ').replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"','\"'+w.costs.join('; ').replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"'].join(',')+'\\n';\n });\n lastCSV=csv;\n $('weeks').querySelector('tbody').innerHTML=rows;\n var lowTxt=lowWeek?'week of '+nice(lowWeek.start):'today';\n var lowCls=low<0?'bad':(low<buffer?'mid':'');\n $('stats').innerHTML=\n  '<div class=\"stat '+lowCls+'\"><b>'+money(low)+'</b><span>Lowest balance ('+lowTxt+')</span></div>'+\n  '<div class=\"stat\"><b>'+money(running)+'</b><span>Balance after 13 weeks</span></div>'+\n  '<div class=\"stat\"><b>'+money(tin)+'</b><span>Expected in</span></div>'+\n  '<div class=\"stat\"><b>'+money(tout)+'</b><span>Going out</span></div>'+\n  '<div class=\"stat '+(neg?'bad':(below?'mid':''))+'\"><b>'+(neg+below)+'</b><span>Weeks under your cushion'+(neg?' ('+neg+' below zero)':'')+'</span></div>';\n var v=$('verdict');\n if(neg){var first=weeks.filter(function(w){return w.end<0})[0];v.className='verdict bad';v.innerHTML='<b>Cash runs out in the week of '+nice(first.start)+'.</b> You would be '+money(-first.end)+' short. Look at the tips below: bringing one invoice forward or moving one cost may be enough.'}\n else if(below){var f2=weeks.filter(function(w){return w.end<buffer})[0];v.className='verdict mid';v.innerHTML='<b>You stay above zero, but dip under your cushion from the week of '+nice(f2.start)+'.</b> Lowest point: '+money(low)+', '+money(buffer-low)+' under the cushion.'}\n else{v.className='verdict';v.innerHTML='<b>You stay above your cushion all 13 weeks.</b> Try the stress test: add 14 days of lateness and leave out planned invoices.'}\n var lt='';\n if(overdue.length)lt+='<p class=\"hint\"><b>Already past their expected pay date</b> (counted in week 1, chase these now): '+esc(overdue.map(function(o){return o.name+' '+money(o.amt)}).join(', '))+'.</p>';\n if(later.length)lt+='<p class=\"hint\"><b>Landing after these 13 weeks:</b> '+esc(later.map(function(o){return o.name+' '+money(o.amt)+' ('+nice(o.pay)+')'}).join(', '))+'.</p>';\n if(skipped)lt+='<p class=\"hint\">Planned invoices left out: '+money(skipped)+'.</p>';\n $('later').innerHTML=lt;\n chart(weeks,bal,buffer);\n}\nfunction chart(weeks,bal,buffer){\n var w=760,h=240,pl=60,pr=10,pt=12,pb=28;\n var vals=weeks.map(function(x){return x.end});vals.push(bal,buffer,0);\n var mx=Math.max.apply(null,vals),mn=Math.min.apply(null,vals);if(mx===mn)mx=mn+1;\n var span=mx-mn;mx+=span*.05;mn-=mn<0?span*.05:0;\n function y(v){return pt+(mx-v)/(mx-mn)*(h-pt-pb)}\n var bw=(w-pl-pr)/weeks.length,s='<svg viewBox=\"0 0 '+w+' '+h+'\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Balance at the end of each week\">';\n for(var g=0;g<=4;g++){var gv=mn+(mx-mn)*g/4;s+='<line x1=\"'+pl+'\" x2=\"'+(w-pr)+'\" y1=\"'+y(gv)+'\" y2=\"'+y(gv)+'\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"'+(pl-6)+'\" y=\"'+(y(gv)+4)+'\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--mute)\">'+money(gv)+'</text>'}\n var z=y(0);\n weeks.forEach(function(wk,i){var x=pl+i*bw+bw*.15,bwid=bw*.7,yy=y(wk.end),top=Math.min(yy,z),ht=Math.max(1,Math.abs(z-yy));\n  var col=wk.end<buffer?'var(--warn)':'var(--acc)';\n  s+='<rect x=\"'+x+'\" y=\"'+top+'\" width=\"'+bwid+'\" height=\"'+ht+'\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"'+col+'\"><title>'+nice(wk.start)+': '+money(wk.end)+'</title></rect>';\n  if(i%2===0)s+='<text x=\"'+(x+bwid/2)+'\" y=\"'+(h-10)+'\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--mute)\">'+nice(wk.start)+'</text>'});\n s+='<line x1=\"'+pl+'\" x2=\"'+(w-pr)+'\" y1=\"'+z+'\" y2=\"'+z+'\" stroke=\"var(--mute)\"/>';\n s+='<line x1=\"'+pl+'\" x2=\"'+(w-pr)+'\" y1=\"'+y(buffer)+'\" y2=\"'+y(buffer)+'\" stroke=\"var(--amber)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>';\n $('chart').innerHTML=s+'</svg>';\n}\nfunction example(){\n $('invRows').innerHTML='';$('costRows').innerHTML='';\n var t=new Date();var mon=addDays(t,-((t.getDay()+6)%7));\n $('start').value=iso(mon);$('bal').value=5600;$('buffer').value=2500;\n function d(n){return iso(addDays(mon,n))}\n [{name:'Studio Nine - brand refresh',amt:3200,date:d(-24),terms:30,late:12,status:'sent'},\n  {name:'Greenway Dental - monthly retainer',amt:1500,date:d(-3),terms:14,late:0,status:'sent'},\n  {name:'Lantern Books - cover design',amt:850,date:d(-40),terms:30,late:5,status:'sent'},\n  {name:'Greenway Dental - monthly retainer',amt:1500,date:d(28),terms:14,late:0,status:'planned'},\n  {name:'Lantern Books - series covers',amt:1700,date:d(14),terms:30,late:5,status:'planned'},\n  {name:'Northfield Gym - website, milestone 2',amt:2400,date:d(21),terms:30,late:18,status:'planned'},\n  {name:'Greenway Dental - monthly retainer',amt:1500,date:d(56),terms:14,late:0,status:'planned'},\n  {name:'Northfield Gym - website, final',amt:1600,date:d(63),terms:30,late:18,status:'planned'}\n ].forEach(invRow);\n [{name:'Pay myself',amt:2800,freq:'m',date:d(4)},\n  {name:'Rent share / studio',amt:650,freq:'m',date:d(0)},\n  {name:'Software and tools',amt:120,freq:'m',date:d(9)},\n  {name:'Tax set-aside',amt:250,freq:'w',date:d(4)},\n  {name:'Laptop replacement',amt:900,freq:'o',date:d(35)}\n ].forEach(costRow);\n calc();\n}\ndocument.addEventListener('input',function(e){if(e.target.closest('main'))calc()});\ndocument.addEventListener('change',function(e){if(e.target.closest('main'))calc()});\ndocument.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n var b=e.target.closest('button');if(!b)return;\n if(b.classList.contains('x')){b.closest('.row').remove();calc()}\n else if(b.id==='addInv'){invRow({date:iso(new Date())});calc()}\n else if(b.id==='addCost'){costRow({date:iso(new Date())});calc()}\n else if(b.id==='example')example();\n else if(b.id==='clear'){$('invRows').innerHTML='';$('costRows').innerHTML='';invRow({date:iso(new Date())});costRow({date:iso(new Date())});$('bal').value=0;$('delay').value=0;calc()}\n else if(b.id==='copy'){\n  var msg=$('copyMsg');\n  function fallback(){var ta=document.createElement('textarea');ta.value=lastCSV;document.body.appendChild(ta);ta.select();try{document.execCommand('copy');msg.textContent='Copied. Paste into a spreadsheet.'}catch(err){msg.textContent='Copy failed. Select the table and copy it instead.'}ta.remove()}\n  if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(lastCSV).then(function(){msg.textContent='Copied. Paste into a spreadsheet.'},fallback)}else fallback();\n }\n});\nexample();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n"
}